# Custom env injected into every launch (`claude-code configure` → settings → environment writes it).
# Copy to env.d/custom.env to seed by hand. Harness-managed keys (ANTHROPIC_*, routing) always win.
# KEY=@keyring takes the value from the OS keyring under KEY (claude-code secrets set KEY).
#
# MY_PROJECT_ROOT=/home/me/work
# SOME_API_TOKEN=@keyring
